GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4430260,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4430260-1847286114031597","game_id":"steam-4430260","kind":"announcement","title":"💜 40K Wishlists! Thank You So Much!","summary":"Hey beat riders!We're now on Day 4 of Steam Next Fest, and Beat For Speed has reached 40,000 wishlists! 🎉 Thank you so much for all the support. It means a lot to our tiny 3-person team!Wishlist & Play the Beat For Speed Demo!Haven't tried the demo yet? Now's a great time to jump in, ride to your favorite music, and see what Beat For Speed is all about!If you're enjoying the game, don't forget to add it to your WISHLIST and join us for our full launch on November 3rd! We'll share more about our ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:41:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031597","verified_at":"2026-10-22T09:53:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4430260-1846018067940666","game_id":"steam-4430260","kind":"announcement","title":"Beat For Speed is joining Steam Next Fest!🎵","summary":"Hello everyone, it’s the Beat For Speed team!We’re excited to share some big news:Beat For Speed will be part of Steam Next Fest this month!We’ve been working hard on a big demo update, and we’re bringing some new features and new content for everyone to try:Live Audio ModeOne of the biggest updates is Live Audio Mode.You no longer need the music files. Simply play music on your device (any music player including browsers), and Beat For Speed will transform it into a real-time playable experienc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T11:30:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940666","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4430260-1841579228677850","game_id":"steam-4430260","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 The Beat For Speed Demo Is Here!!","summary":"The Beat For Speed Demo is now LIVE on Steam! 🎵Bring your favorite music into the game, hit the rhythm, dodge the traffic, and experience the ride for yourself.🛠️ Help Us Make It BetterThis is our first public demo, so you may encounter some bugs, rough edges, or things that aren't quite polished yet. We really appreciate your patience and understanding!If you run into a bug or have a suggestion, please join our Discord and let us know. Your feedback is incredibly valuable and will help us impro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T10:07:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228677850","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4430260-1836506165575856","game_id":"steam-4430260","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest 3.0 Recap & What's Next","summary":"First of all, thank you to everyone who joined our third closed playtest! ❤️We've been reading through every survey response, bug report, and suggestion you sent us from Playtest 3.0. Your feedback has been incredibly valuable, and it's already helping shape the future of Beat For Speed.🎮 Overall ExperienceOne of the questions we asked was:\"How much fun was your overall game experience?\"We're happy to share that the vast majority of players rated the experience between 7–10/10, which is incredib","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T12:15:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165575856","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4430260-1834602721184186","game_id":"steam-4430260","kind":"announcement","title":"What Changed Since Our First Playtest?","summary":"Over the past month we've been collecting feedback from early players and working on some of the most requested improvements.The Closed Playtest 2.0 is here, and we'd love to share what has changed since our first test.🏍️ Improved Driving FeelOne of the biggest pieces of feedback we received was that the driving and impacts could feel more satisfying.For this update we've reworked several parts of the driving experience, including:5 new camera perspectives (press \"V\" to switch between 1st and 3r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-03T08:30:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721184186","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4430260-1833334318579143","game_id":"steam-4430260","kind":"announcement","title":"DEV LOG #04 | New Map & Fresh Palettes Are Here! 🗺️🎨✨","summary":"Hey Riders!We’ve got a fresh look for you today! We're adding more weather conditions to our maps for you to vibe with, alongside some gorgeous new color palettes to give the game a fresh, vibrant aesthetic.Check out the new screenshots and videos below!🎨 Fresh Visuals Screenshots:🗺️ Latest Footage:Mixed:Rainy Night's Cold: If you have any feedback on the new visuals, drop a comment below.All of these new maps and color themes will be available in the upcoming patch. Plus, we will be opening a C","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-26T11:43:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318579143","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4430260-1831432155575239","game_id":"steam-4430260","kind":"announcement","title":"DEV LOG #03 | You Asked, We Built: The City Map is Here!","summary":"Two weeks ago, a comment on our TikTok caught our eye:We thought—why not? We don't want to just build a game, we want to build a community. So We took that request to heart, and spent the last weeks bringing a metropolitan pulse to the world of Beat For Speed.For this map, we stayed true to our aesthetic. As you can see in the comparison below, we moved from the initial blockout phase (the \"whitebox\" on the left) to a fully realized twilight cityscape. It’s not just a city, it’s a rhythmic circu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-03T10:57:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155575239","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4430260-1830797770238772","game_id":"steam-4430260","kind":"update","title":"DEV LOG #02| Major Update: Play Your Own Music is Here! 🎧🔥","summary":"Hello Riders,We are excited to share the arrival of Local Music Support. You can now bring your own library into the game and experience custom levels.The Tech Behind the BeatsWe know how important \"flow\" is in a rhythm game. That’s why we didn’t take any shortcuts. We spent months building our own algorithm, the level generation is powered by a custom algorithm we trained strictly on hundreds of our own manually designed levels to ensure the best rhythm.🎧🔥 This ensures that every note feels int","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-25T15:40:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770238772","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4430260-1827626365752427","game_id":"steam-4430260","kind":"announcement","title":"DEV LOG #01| Glimpse of the Auto Generator and Level Editor","summary":"Hello Riders, In our very first Dev Log, you may take a first look at this core feature of Beat For Speed: built-in level editor.Please note: The footage shown is an early-stage demo. We are currently training our rhythm-analysis models and fine-tuning the generation algorithms. We are optimizing how the game \"feels\" the music to ensure every beat translates into a satisfying racing experience.Let us know what you think?","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-19T08:51:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365752427","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4430260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:43Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:43Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4430260":"2026-10-26T02:30:43Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4430260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4550260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4430260","app_id":4430260,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"c302be11bddd303fb05ee3be760c3505661ae987efaf5ffd40a8317f2c7e229f","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"어떤 노래든 플레이할 수 있는 리듬 코스로 바꿔 보세요! 좋아하는 음악을 가져오거나, 라이브 오디오 모드로 PC에서 재생되는 소리에 맞춰 플레이하세요. 인디 아티스트의 공식 트랙을 즐기고, 순위표에 도전하고, 레벨 에디터로 나만의 레벨을 만들고, Steam 창작마당에서 커뮤니티 레벨을 찾아보세요.","publishers":[{"name":"CyanCoast"}],"developers":[{"name":"CyanCoast"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793664000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"NEXT FEST PV","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792572305","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4430260/361735865/d6da2090db22fe1b43c58768c026b59733385bb6/1792398573/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4430260/361735865/d6da2090db22fe1b43c58768c026b59733385bb6/1792398573/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"4430260/361735865/d6da2090db22fe1b43c58768c026b59733385bb6/1792398573/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"4430260/361735865/d6da2090db22fe1b43c58768c026b59733385bb6/1792398573/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"4430260/361735865/d6da2090db22fe1b43c58768c026b59733385bb6/1792398573/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257466577/6f56f80ddd343060d7dbaaebe4cf3ce9c3c3129c/movie_600x337.jpg","screenshot_full":"257466577/6f56f80ddd343060d7dbaaebe4cf3ce9c3c3129c/movie_full.jpg","trailer_base_id":1389696,"all_ages":true}]}},"field_present":{"basic_info":true,"release":true,"trailers":true},"field_status":{"basic_info":"ok","release":"ok","trailers":"ok"},"field_errors":{},"developers":["CyanCoast"],"publishers":["CyanCoast"],"release":{"steam_release_date":1793664000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"NEXT FEST PV","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792572305","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4430260/361735865/d6da2090db22fe1b43c58768c026b59733385bb6/1792398573/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4430260/361735865/d6da2090db22fe1b43c58768c026b59733385bb6/1792398573/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adapti